   </row>
   <row>
    <id><![CDATA[34114]]></id>
    <gid><![CDATA[35470]]></gid>
    <group_name><![CDATA[Introduction:]]></group_name>
    <description><![CDATA[<p> </p>

<p><meta charset="UTF-8" /></p>

<p>In this study, you will view <span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>three</strong></span> short illustrated stories in random order:<span style="font-size:16px;"> Scenarios <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong>, and <strong>C</strong>.</span><br /><br />Please <strong><span style="font-size:16px;">imagine</span></strong> that you are <span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>Alex</strong></span>. You own Ohbot, a small <span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>social robot</strong></span> that serves as your <span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>personal assistant</strong></span> at home, and you wear a <strong><span style="font-size:16px;">smartwatch</span></strong>. Ohbot may ask for permissions on your smartwatch.<br /> </p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;">Alex stands; Ohbot, your personal assistant, sits on the cabinet.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Alex wears the smartwatch; Ohbot, your personal assistant, sits on the cabinet." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/intro-people.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>
]]></description>
    <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
    <sid><![CDATA[841423]]></sid>
    <group_order><![CDATA[3]]></group_order>
    <randomization_group/>
    <grelevance><![CDATA[1]]></grelevance>
   </row>
   <row>
    <id><![CDATA[34115]]></id>
    <gid><![CDATA[35471]]></gid>
    <group_name/>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="text-align:center;font-size:2.2em;margin:4px 0 16px">Scenario A</h2>

<p><span style="font-size:14px;"><b>Location:</b> Alex's living room<br /><b>People:</b> Alex, Jordan and Ohbot<br /><b>Reminder:</b> <b style="font-size:1.2em">“Personal relationship counselling session at 3 PM today”</b>. Alex sets this reminder at noon, before Jordan arrives: </span></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>1.</b> At noon, before Jordan arrives, Alex sets the reminder with Ohbot.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="At noon, before Jordan arrives, Alex sets the reminder with Ohbot." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j1-set-reminder-counselling-1200.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>2.</b> Jordan visits Alex.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Jordan visits Alex." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j2-jordan-arrives.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>3.</b> Alex and Jordan are chatting.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Alex and Jordan are chatting." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j3-chat-0250.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>4.</b> At 3 PM Ohbot <b style="font-size:1.2em">says the reminder out loud</b>, <b style="font-size:1.2em">without asking</b>.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="At 3 PM Ohbot says the reminder out loud, without asking." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j6-said-aloud-counselling-0300.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><b>Please look at all pictures before answering.</b></span></p>
]]></description>
    <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
    <sid><![CDATA[841423]]></sid>
    <group_order><![CDATA[4]]></group_order>
    <randomization_group><![CDATA[STORY]]></randomization_group>
    <grelevance><![CDATA[1]]></grelevance>
   </row>
   <row>
    <id><![CDATA[34116]]></id>
    <gid><![CDATA[35472]]></gid>
    <group_name/>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="text-align:center;font-size:2.2em;margin:4px 0 16px">Scenario B</h2>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><b>Location:</b> Alex's living room<br /><b>People:</b> Alex, Jordan and Ohbot<br /><b>Reminder:</b> <b style="font-size:1.2em">“Personal relationship counselling session at 3 PM today”</b>. Alex sets this reminder at noon, before Jordan arrives: one week ago.</span></p>

<h1>One week ago</h1>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;">Jordan visited Alex. When the private reminder was due, Ohbot heard that someone else was in the room, so before saying anything it <b style="font-size:1.2em">asked Alex on the smartwatch</b>: <i>“I have noticed that someone is present with you. Do you want me to send private reminders in front of them?”</i> Alex tapped <b style="font-size:1.2em">Yes</b>, and Ohbot said the reminder out loud. Ohbot <b style="font-size:1.2em">did not save</b> Alex’s answer.</span></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>1.</b> At noon, before Jordan arrives, Alex sets the reminder with Ohbot.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="At noon, before Jordan arrives, Alex sets the reminder with Ohbot." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j1-set-reminder-counselling-1200.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>2.</b> Jordan visits Alex.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Jordan visits Alex." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j2-jordan-arrives.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>3.</b> Alex and Jordan are chatting. Ohbot hears that someone else is in the room.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Alex and Jordan are chatting. Ohbot hears that someone else is in the room." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j3-chat-0250.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>4.</b> Before saying anything, Ohbot <b style="font-size:1.2em">asks Alex on the smartwatch</b>.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Before saying anything, Ohbot asks Alex on the smartwatch." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j4-watch-asks-0300.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;">How the smartwatch question works: <b style="font-size:1.2em">Yes</b> means Ohbot says the reminder out loud; <b style="font-size:1.2em">No</b> means it appears only on the smartwatch.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="How the smartwatch question works: Yes means Ohbot says the reminder out loud; No means it appears only on the smartwatch." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/How%20Ohbot%20asks_%20Yes%20_%20No.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:48px;"><b>5.</b> Alex taps <b style="font-size:1.2em">Yes</b>.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Alex taps Yes." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j5-watch-yes-0300.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>6.</b> At 3 PM Ohbot <b style="font-size:1.2em">says the reminder out loud</b>.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="At 3 PM Ohbot says the reminder out loud." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j6-said-aloud-counselling-0300.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<h1><span style="font-size:24px;">Today</span></h1>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;">Today Alex sets a <b style="font-size:1.2em">NEW reminder</b> for the same appointment, and Jordan visits again. Ohbot <b style="font-size:1.2em">does not remember Jordan</b>, because it did not save last week’s answer, so it <b style="font-size:1.2em">asks Alex on the smartwatch again</b>. Alex taps <b style="font-size:1.2em">Yes</b> again, and Ohbot says the reminder out loud.</span></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>7.</b> Today: at noon Alex sets a <b style="font-size:1.2em">NEW reminder</b>: “Personal relationship counselling session at 3 PM today”.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Today: at noon Alex sets a NEW reminder: “Personal relationship counselling session at 3 PM today”." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/t1-set-reminder-counselling-1200.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>8.</b> Jordan visits again; they are chatting.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Jordan visits again; they are chatting." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/t2-chat-0250.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>9.</b> Ohbot <b style="font-size:1.2em">does not remember Jordan</b>, so it <b style="font-size:1.2em">asks again</b>.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Ohbot does not remember Jordan, so it asks again." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/t3-ohbot-asks-again-0300.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>10.</b> Ohbot <b style="font-size:1.2em">asks Alex on the smartwatch again</b>.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Ohbot asks Alex on the smartwatch again." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j4-watch-asks-0300.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>11.</b> Alex taps <b style="font-size:1.2em">Yes</b> again.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="Alex taps Yes again." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/j5-watch-yes-0300.png" style="max-width: 100%;" /></p>

<p style="font-size:1.25em;line-height:1.4;margin:22px 0 6px"><span style="font-size:36px;"><b>12.</b> At 3 PM Ohbot <b style="font-size:1.2em">says the reminder out loud</b>.</span></p>

<p style="margin-top:0"><img alt="At 3 PM Ohbot says the reminder out loud." src="/upload/surveys/841423/images/t4-said-aloud-counselling-0300.png" style="max-width:100%;height:auto" /></p>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><b>Please look at all pictures before answering.</b></span></p>
]]></description>
    <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
    <sid><![CDATA[841423]]></sid>
    <group_order><![CDATA[5]]></group_order>
    <randomization_group><![CDATA[STORY]]></randomization_group>
